## Player-written lineups (UGC)

`data/comps.json` contains player-submitted lineups from the official lineup
list. These fields are user-generated content and are reproduced verbatim:

- `brief`, `positionDesc`, `equipDesc`, `operationDetails`
- `tags`, `talentCardDesc`, `effectCardDesc`

Copyright in that text belongs to its respective authors. It is included here
for non-commercial reference as part of a lineup listing, not licensed under
the MIT License. Author accounts, user IDs, avatars and comment objects are
deliberately not included. An author who wants their text removed can open an
issue and it will be dropped from the next data update.

